{"headword":"חָבַק","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. clasp, embrace (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">חַבֵּקֹ</span>; Mand.. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܒܰܩ</span>, NSyr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܦܩ</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَبَقَ</span> ii. <em>collect</em> one’s possessions, etc., Frey<strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחֲבוֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.5\">Ec 3:5</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.5\">Ec 4:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֶקֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.16\">2 K 4:16</a>;—<em>embrace</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.16\">2 K 4:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָדָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.5\">Ec 4:5</a> (said of <span dir=\"rtl\">הַכְּסִיל</span> = fold his arms, i.e. be idle; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חִבֻּק\" href=\"/BDB,_חִבֻּק\", dir=\"rtl\">חִבֻּק</a>); no obj. expr. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.5\">Ec 3:5</a> (‖ <strong>Pi</strong>)."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִבְּקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:5\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.5\">La 4:5</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַבֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:10\" href=\"/Genesis.48.10\">Gn 48:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַבֶּק־</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:13\" href=\"/Genesis.29.13\">Gn 29:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַבְּקֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:4\" href=\"/Genesis.33.4\">Gn 33:4</a>; 3 fs. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחַבְּקֵ֫נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.6\">Ct 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.3\">8:3</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּתְחַבֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:20\" hr